  "body": "Set on a 592sqm section in Millwater, this spacious single-level family home offers approximately 206m² of floor area. Four bedrooms, a separate study and two bathrooms cater to everyday family needs, while two living areas provide plenty of room to relax and spend time together.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and family area is the heart of the home. The kitchen offers plenty of bench space for meal preparation, with a walk-in pantry to keep things tidy and organised. Sliding doors lead out to a covered deck, a lovely spot for weekend lunches or catching up with friends.\r\n\r\nNear the entrance, the spacious separate lounge bathed in the sunlight is a comfortable, welcoming space to host guests or simply relax. The master bedroom includes a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while three further bedrooms share a family bathroom. Both bathrooms are beautifully presented, adding to the home’s appeal. A separate study provides a dedicated space for work or homework.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\n• Single-level home on a 592m² section\r\n• Approximately 206m² floor area\r\n• Four bedrooms plus a separate study\r\n• Two beautifully presented bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Generous separate lounge near the entrance\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and family area\r\n• Kitchen with plenty of bench space and a walk-in pantry\r\n• Covered deck for outdoor dining and entertaining\r\n• Internal-access double garage\r\n\r\nSet in Millwater, you’re close to local parks, schools, shops and everyday amenities. Convenient motorway access makes getting around easy.\r\n\r\nFor families looking for more space in Millwater, this home is well worth a look. Come along to the open home or contact us today for more information.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
